            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Richard Willey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After making and trying these, I have to tell you this is nothing more than a salt delivery device. Now if eating liquid salt is your thing, then this recipe is for you, otherwise, I would pass on it as they were really quite bad. These rate no stars at all, but you have to give them at least one to write the review, so I gave it the one out of no choice of my own.",
